      "text": "<math><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn></math> and <math><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>",
